# Nykthos, Shrine to Nyx counts both doors of Unholy Annex // Ritual Chamber once both are unlocked (CR 709.5, 700.5): the Room's
# mana cost is {2}{B} and {3}{B}{B} together, three black symbols, so Nykthos adds {B}{B}{B}. Setup is the door-unlocking line of
# room-unlock-the-other-door-is-a-sorcery-speed-special-action-that-triggers-and-renames-it, then Nykthos on turn 7.

